Package: vaultproxy
Version: 0.2.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-httpx, python3-pydantic
Maintainer: Aniket Chaudhary <aniketchaudharyaa113@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Local-first, OpenAI-compatible privacy proxy for LLM applications
 VaultProxy intercepts prompt payloads to mask sensitive Indian personal data
 and API secrets using deterministic checksum rules before forwarding upstream,
 and restores original values in real time on streaming responses.
